05_endpoint visual legend

solid_wire: #00BE00 RGB(0, 190, 0) - retained solid wire
dash_group: #FF9100 RGB(255, 145, 0) - retained dashed wire group
connection_dot: #0078FF RGB(0, 120, 255) - connection dot inferred from disconnected endpoints; actual blob pixels only
round_terminal_object: #0050FF RGB(0, 80, 255) - round terminal inferred from one disconnected endpoint; actual blob pixels only
ground_terminal: #FF0000 RGB(255, 0, 0) - local GND terminal inferred from disconnected endpoints; actual blob pixels only
small_connected_structure: #00D2D2 RGB(0, 210, 210) - small endpoint-attached residual structure
arrow_structure: #0078FF RGB(0, 120, 255) - endpoint-attached arrow terminal structure
brace_structure: #BE007D RGB(190, 0, 125) - flat endpoint-attached brace structure with V-shaped join
rectangle_frame: #AA782D RGB(170, 120, 45) - rectangle frame suppression boundary
